graph TD
    A[Network Packet Arrival] --> B[Protocol Detection]
    B --> C{Is RTP?}
    C -->|No| D[Other Protocol Handler]
    C -->|Yes| E[Extract RTP Header]
    
    E --> F[Parse Header Fields]
    F --> G[Version Check]
    F --> H[Payload Type]
    F --> I[Sequence Number]
    F --> J[Timestamp]
    F --> K[SSRC]
    
    G --> L{Version = 2?}
    L -->|No| M[Discard Packet]
    L -->|Yes| N[Find/Create RTP Stream]
    
    N --> O[SSRC Lookup]
    O --> P{Stream Exists?}
    P -->|No| Q[Create New RTP Object]
    P -->|Yes| R[Use Existing Stream]
    
    Q --> S[Initialize RTP Statistics]
    S --> T[Set Stream Parameters]
    T --> U[Add to Call RTP Array]
    
    R --> V[Validate Sequence]
    U --> V
    V --> W[Calculate Jitter]
    W --> X[Update Statistics]
    
    X --> Y[Codec Processing]
    Y --> Z{Codec Change?}
    Z -->|Yes| AA[Update Codec Info]
    Z -->|No| BB[Extract Payload]
    AA --> BB
    
    BB --> CC[Jitter Buffer Processing]
    CC --> DD[Quality Analysis]
    DD --> EE[MOS Calculation]
    
    EE --> FF[Update Database]
    FF --> GG[Generate Statistics]
    
    %% SRTP Branch
    H --> HH{SRTP Encrypted?}
    HH -->|Yes| II[SRTP Decryption]
    HH -->|No| BB
    II --> JJ[Key Derivation]
    JJ --> KK[Decrypt Payload]
    KK --> BB
    
    %% Error Handling
    V --> LL{Sequence Valid?}
    LL -->|No| MM[Packet Loss Detection]
    LL -->|Yes| W
    MM --> NN[Update Loss Stats]
    NN --> W
    
    %% RTCP Integration
    CC --> OO[RTCP Correlation]
    OO --> PP{RTCP Available?}
    PP -->|Yes| QQ[Merge RTCP Data]
    PP -->|No| DD
    QQ --> DD
    
    %% Styling
    classDef input fill:#e1f5fe
    classDef processing fill:#f3e5f5
    classDef validation fill:#e8f5e8
    classDef quality fill:#fff3e0
    classDef security fill:#ffebee
    classDef output fill:#fce4ec
    classDef error fill:#ffcdd2
    
    class A,B input
    class E,F,G,H,I,J,K,N,O processing
    class C,L,P,Z,HH,LL,PP validation
    class W,X,DD,EE quality
    class II,JJ,KK security
    class FF,GG output
    class M,MM,NN error